NOTE FOR TEMPLATE CONSUMERS

This proprietary notice is the deliberate default because it is reversible:
a project can always be relicensed under permissive terms later, but content
published under a permissive license cannot be withdrawn.

If a project bootstrapped from this template is intended to be open source,
replace the text above in full with the chosen license (for example MIT or
Apache-2.0) and record the choice as an ADR under
`docs/architecture/decisions/`. Licensing is a consequential decision and is
governed by the same ADR discipline as architecture.
